#: gpscorrelatorwidget.cpp:276
msgid "Interpolate"
msgstr "Interpolar"

#: gpscorrelatorwidget.cpp:277
msgid ""
"Set this option to interpolate GPS track points which are not closely "
"matched to the GPX data file."
msgstr ""
"Afita esta opción pa interpolar puntos de trazáu GPS que nun son mui "
"coincidentes col ficheru de datos GPX."

#: gpscorrelatorwidget.cpp:283
msgid "Difference in min.:"
msgstr "Diferencia en min.:"

#: gpscorrelatorwidget.cpp:285
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum time difference in minutes (240 max.) to interpolate GPX "
"file points to image time data."
msgstr ""
"Afita la máxima diferencia horaria en minutos (240 máx) pa interpolar puntos "
"de ficheru GPX nos datos d'hora de la imaxe."

